      <abstract>
        <p>We measure the interfacial charge transfer resistance of model electrodes and derive a compact expression for the exchange current as a function of overpotential and temperature.</p>
      </abstract>
      <kwd-group>
        <kwd>sodium-ion battery</kwd>
        <kwd>charge transfer</kwd>
        <kwd>EIS</kwd>
      </kwd-group>
